{"3909220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yuki「清醒梦」", "steam_appid": 3909220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuki</strong> is a narrative horror adventure set in a remote, abandoned school where memories linger longer than the living. <br><br><strong>A story shaped by memory, regret, and choice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words matter. Every conversation and discovery changes how the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible endings — each one reflecting your values and decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the past in fast-paced combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront lingering spirits in bullet hell encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast breakbeats and frenetic rhythms set the pace for intense battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of a closed campus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth through an online chatroom, strange sightings, and whispered regrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only demons here are the memories we carry — and the ones we leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>An online chatroom</strong> filled with rumors.<br>Mysterious sightings no one can explain.<br>A campus abandoned, its classrooms frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the heart of it all — your best friend, missing without a trace.<br>What happened that night before the school closed down?<br>What secrets are still buried in its halls?<br>Move freely through a fully 3D-modeled environment. Interact with characters, examine objects, and solve puzzles to gather clues — each step bringing you closer to the truth.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/1f3ea52b78fa12b5fb7459900171fda3.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/1f3ea52b78fa12b5fb7459900171fda3.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/1f3ea52b78fa12b5fb7459900171fda3.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The only demons here are not monsters of flesh and blood, but the <strong>echoes of regret</strong> left behind.<br>They linger in empty classrooms, drift through silent hallways, and whisper from forgotten corners of the school long after its doors were shut.<br>Each spirit you encounter is bound by unfinished stories, memories that refuse to fade, and choices that can no longer be undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To move forward, you’ll have to face not just their regrets — but your own. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/095415ec5ed4cce7ff2ad9404bd60b74.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/095415ec5ed4cce7ff2ad9404bd60b74.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/095415ec5ed4cce7ff2ad9404bd60b74.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Words matter.</strong> But words alone won’t save you. Confront the lingering spirits, face their relentless attacks in fast-paced bullet hell encounters, and adapt to each situation under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knowledge you’ve gathered from exploring the campus isn’t just for solving puzzles — it’s your weapon. Piece together what you’ve learned, choose your words wisely, and turn memory itself into your advantage.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/513abae1379b5f08e206a6fdfbac4220.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/513abae1379b5f08e206a6fdfbac4220.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/513abae1379b5f08e206a6fdfbac4220.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuki</strong> is a narrative horror adventure set in a remote, abandoned school where memories linger longer than the living. <br><br><strong>A story shaped by memory, regret, and choice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words matter. Every conversation and discovery changes how the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible endings — each one reflecting your values and decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the past in fast-paced combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront lingering spirits in bullet hell encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast breakbeats and frenetic rhythms set the pace for intense battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of a closed campus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth through an online chatroom, strange sightings, and whispered regrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only demons here are the memories we carry — and the ones we leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.poster.avif?t=1761370791\" width=680 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.webm?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909220/extras/693ddb2a171ed27b8de4ce080d4ff33a.mp4?t=1761370791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>An online chatroom</strong> filled with rumors.<br>Mysterious sightings no one can explain.<br>A campus abandoned, its classrooms frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the heart of it all — your best friend, missing without a trace.<br>What happened that night before the school closed down?<br>What secrets are still buried in its halls?<br>Move freely through a fully 3D-modeled environment. Interact with characters, examine objects, and solve puzzles to gather clues — each step bringing you closer to the truth.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_